WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 6</i>

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.020
House of Grand Councilor

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.700
What's going on in the House of Grand Councilor?
They even have guards at the back door.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.790
Seems like they're holding a feast today.

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:00.870
Mochi, go check it out.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.140
Why me again?

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:04.370
You got a problem with that?

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:06.770
Where were you last time I was in danger?

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.930
<i>You're</i> the one who left us in the
private room in that restaurant.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:12.120
Pfft. And why didn't you come looking for me?

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:13.520
Um, Mistress Yunxi...

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:17.290
The House of Grand Councilor is your home.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:19.020
Why not just walk straight in?

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:24.220
Yunxi is here without permission, idiot.
What if her father finds out she's here?

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.500
I made a deal with Father.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.890
If I got married in my sister's stead,
he said he would take care of Auntie Xue. But...

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:33.200
If you promise to stay,

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:36.770
these priceless blood-jade
earrings are yours.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:41.400
Auntie Xue always kept those earrings with
her. They are the only pair in the world.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.390
But my father gave them
to the Crown Prince as a gift.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:46.100
Auntie Xue...

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:51.700
For Auntie Xue's sake, I bit my tongue and 
agreed to all of his unreasonable requests,

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.530
but I can't believe my father
 didn't keep his word.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.340
I will take Auntie Xue with me now,
 and leave this place forever.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.890
But I can't even get in the damn door.

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.640
Mistress Yunxi, do not worry. Look over there.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.130
My princess is still missing?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.770
How is it possible that a young
maiden can elude you so easily?

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.740
Princess Ye is skilled in avoiding
detection. She is no ordinary woman.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.270
We will keep searching.
Please forgive us, Highness.

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:30.640
Qian Yunshang...

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.640
What game are you playing?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.840
Ah, I finally got in.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.010
Shouldn't be so fat.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.600
Are you looking for a fight?!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.100
Who is out there?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.270
Uh-oh, someone's coming.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.270
I will lure her away.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:58.810
Wait.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.790
That voice...

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:06.470
Que'er!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.250
Hold your stick!

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:27.870
Mistress Yunxi?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.270
Did you miss me?

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:35.020
Court Yiya

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:39.620
My lady, I never thought
you would suffer so...

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:43.750
That's why I came back today.
So we can run away together.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:46.040
Where's Auntie Xue?

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:49.420
Auntie Xue? I do not know
her whereabouts, either.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.770
The mistress said Auntie Xue had
malaria, so she could not stay here.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.930
They kicked her out.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:01.140
On top of that, the mistress took
all of Auntie Xue's valuables.

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:03.500
So it was all that woman's doing...

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:06.140
What about Father? Did he say anything?

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:09.560
He does not get involved.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:13.450
The mistress is in charge
of all household matters.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.880
After you left, Mistress Yunshang
made life very difficult for us.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.750
Don't worry.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.310
I will go to Father now and set this right.

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:25.410
But wait...

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:29.720
We have an important guest today, my lady.
I'm afraid... you might not get to see the master.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.290
An important guest?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.040
The head of the Western Tribe, Beitang Lie.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:41.000
The master has cozied up to him recently. 
It feels like something is afoot.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.140
He has also caught Mistress Yunshang's eye.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.110
Beitang Lie?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.890
Que'er! Are you slacking off again? Get out here!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.140
Oh no! Auntie Deng!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:56.910
Move it!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.650
I told you to get to work,
yet here you are slacking off?!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:07.140
I'm sorry! I won't do it again!

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:11.140
Big bully. I need to talk to Father <i>now</i>.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:16.460
Halt! Who are you?

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.390
The first daughter of the House of
Grand Councilor, here to see my father.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.890
The only daughter here is
Mistress Qian Yunshang.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:25.020
Where did you spring from, impostor?

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.970
We have an important guest today. Lock her up.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:31.000
What are you doing?
Are the preparations made?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:29.970
<i>Father?</i>

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:35.470
Where is she?

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:42.350
Why does nobody recognize you here?
Are you really the Grand Councilor's daughter?

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.100
They bully me 'cause I only 
lived here a short time.

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:50.110
Most of the people here didn't
like me when I was still at home.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.350
Only Auntie Xue and Que'er were nice to me.

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:57.730
My father sent me to Spirit Cloud Mountain
when I was seven. I haven't been back since.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:01.130
It's no wonder no one knows me now.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:07.470
What am I going to do now?! I need to 
at least get as far as the entrance hall!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.710
We have an important guest 
visiting today, so stay sharp.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.130
Yes, miss.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:19.970
I have an idea.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:29.850
How do I look?

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:34.290
Mistress Yunxi, you look beautiful 
even in a servant's dress.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.470
Ass kisser.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.380
You look stunning, Mistress Yunxi.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.720
Shhh, they're coming.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.970
Keep an eye on her. Make sure no one finds her.

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:47.810
Yes, mistress.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:48.970
Be careful.

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:14.100
Hey, so um, when do we go in?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.990
When the music stops,
we start serving the food.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.400
You must be new here.
I have not seen your face before.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:22.470
Oh, uh, y-yeah.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:26.520
If there is anything you are unsure of,
just do what I do. We cannot afford mistakes.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.980
Thank you. You are such a kind person.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.790
What a glorious day. Such beautiful 
weather and blossoming flowers.

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.380
Your timing could not be better, Lord Beitang.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:39.600
Indeed.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.970
The scenery here in the Central
Plains invites one to stay longer.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:49.720
Thanks to you, Grand Councilor,
our tribe could reconcile with your nation,

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:53.440
and I have the opportunity 
to visit here again.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.000
You flatter me, Lord Beitang.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.600
I am merely doing my part, however small,
to foster peace between our nations.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:15.990
Now, stay in your lines, enter in 
single file, and serve with care.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:25.490
Many bandits and thieves have been
spotted near Xiyun Pass recently.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.600
I wonder if there are enough 
guards to protect the merchants.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.160
Worry not, Lord Beitang.

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:36.350
We have two thousand trained soldiers 
guarding the Xiyun Pass from bandit attack.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:38.910
Sounds perfect.

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:39.920
Perfect.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.390
<i><i>So this is where Father is.</i></i>

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.520
<i><i>I have to make him notice me.</i></i>

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:17.840
We have prepared a few sculpted
dishes for you, Lord Beitang.

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:21.200
Look. This "Picture of 
Scenery" maps the shape

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:24.410
of the rivers and mountains 
of our nations in one dish.

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:28.020
A metaphor for our prosperity and peace.

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:32.930
A most creative way to use 
cuisine to symbolize peace.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.220
A wise choice, Grand Councilor.

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:39.890
I thank you for the compliment.

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.640
<i>Why does that man keep staring at me?</i>

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.270
Are you okay?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.020
Clumsy fool! Have you any
 idea what you have done?!

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.150
Forgive me, my lord! Please, have mercy on me!

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:31.020
Take her away and flog her eighty times!

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.340
Wait!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:36.890
Master, that would be inappropriate
in front of our honored guests.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:42.520
<i>As long as Father recognizes me,
I can end this peacefully.</i>

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.040
How dare you answer back!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:48.540
Take them both away and 
flog them! Flog them soundly!

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:51.200
<i>Wait, what? He didn't recognize me?</i>

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.410
Do not get so irate, Father.

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:07.300
There is no need to let the 
actions of two maids enrage you.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:10.390
<i><i>Qian Yunshang? What's </i>she<i> doing here?</i></i>

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.100
After you left, Mistress Yunshang
made life very difficult for us.

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.600
Whatever they have done
 to anger you so, Father...

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.740
<i><i>No, now isn't the right time.</i></i>

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:25.590
This maid is insolent in the extreme, and has 
ruined our centerpiece, "Picture of Scenery."

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:28.520
She may have cursed the
peace between our nations!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.720
Is that so?

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:34.320
From what I can see,
I believe this is a good omen.

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.440
A good omen?

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:38.100
How is that possible?

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:42.270
The Central Plains and 
Western Tribe are like brothers.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:45.700
Now, like milk mixing with water,
we are in perfect harmony,

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.520
signifying an even closer 
relationship than before.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.980
My, my, what a silver tongue you have, daughter.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.590
It is all down to your teaching, Father.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.640
Lord Beitang, I apologize
for that little scene.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.340
This is my daughter, Qian Yunshang.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.190
Yunshang, this is Lord Beitang.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:26.640
Greetings, Lord Beitang.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.760
Shang'er, you are late.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:33.410
Lord Beitang must be upset that you 
kept him waiting. Apologize to him.

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:36.770
I am deeply sorry, Lord Beitang.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.640
Oh, do not worry.

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:45.270
<i>Why does he keep looking at me 
instead of Qian Yunshang?</i>

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:51.660
When Shang'er heard Lord 
Beitang would be in attendance,

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.000
she had a new dress 
tailored for the occasion.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.280
Oh, Mother, please.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:14:00.000
Her thoughtful comment
a moment ago was excellent.

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.770
These two maids did not err on purpose.

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:05.520
Please reduce your 
punishment, Grand Councilor.

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:09.430
<i><i>He's pleading on my behalf?</i></i>

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:14.360
Father, since Lord Beitang wishes it,

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:18.250
why not consider a lighter punishment, 
such as docking them one month's pay?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.170
<i>Even Qian Yunshang?</i>

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.890
<i>Is the sun rising in the west?</i>

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.850
Shang'er, you are always so kind.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:32.250
Very well. For their sake, you will
each be docked one month's pay.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.830
Now, leave.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.520
Thank you, master!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.850
Thank you, master!

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.500
Father didn't recognize me?

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.350
Are my makeup skills <i>that</i> good?

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:50.690
For Qian Yunshang to defend me, too...

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:51.770
What's she up to?

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.500
Do not be upset, Mistress Yunxi.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:01.140
Grand Councilor did not talk to you because
there were important guests present.

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:06.940
The Spirit Cloud Mountain crew
has makeup skills you can't outdo.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:14.350
Not only have I got serious makeup
skills, I'm also blessed with luck.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.740
Guess which nice person saved me today?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.830
M-Mistress Yunxi... Behind you...

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:24.270
Would this "nice person" you mention... be me?

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:43.580
Would this "nice person" you mention... be me?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:56.270
<i><i>The man who couldn't keep his 
eyes off me during the feast...</i></i>

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:10.700
I, uh, was talking about
Mistress Qian Yunshang.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.140
What business is it of yours?

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:17.830
Please excuse me.
I thought you looked familiar.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.960
Might I know your name?

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:26.990
<i><i>Why's this guy so persistent?</i></i>

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.160
<i><i>I can't stay here for long.</i></i>

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.560
Why should I tell you?

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:46.160
Please wait.

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:50.350
Let go of me!

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.300
Mistress Yunxi, I will save you.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.370
Watch out for incoming cakes!

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.020
Why do I itch so all of a sudden?

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:22.480
Watch out.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.890
Telekinesis?

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:34.060
What technique is this?

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:39.280
A woman's self-defense technique.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.390
Your Highness, our agent has reported in.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:03.360
Grand Councilor hosted a feast today for
the leader of the Western Tribe, Beitang Lie.

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:09.060
Furthermore, Princess Ye is in
the House of Grand Councilor.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:13.310
As I thought. She is a spy sent by Qian Aotian.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.180
All right. Let us go see them.
